      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Getting Started"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0389f7cb2944",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "overview",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Overview"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1b5c98a6d044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Vite (French word for \"quick\", pronounced "
        },
        {
          "text": "/viːt/",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", like \"veet\") is a build tool that aims to provide a faster and leaner development experience for modern web projects. It consists of two major parts:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fa4179d1dc61",
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "5bc0d58c5150",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "A dev server that provides "
                },
                {
                  "text": "rich feature enhancements",
                  "link": {
                    "href": "https://vite.dev/guide/features",
                    "kind": "same_domain"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": " over "
                },
                {
                  "text": "native ES modules",
                  "link": {
                    "href": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Modules",
                    "kind": "external"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": ", for example extremely fast "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Hot Module Replacement (HMR)",
                  "link": {
                    "href": "https://vite.dev/guide/features#hot-module-replacement",
                    "kind": "same_domain"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "3567d3f93ee7",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "A build command that bundles your code with "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Rolldown",
                  "link": {
                    "href": "https://rolldown.rs",
                    "kind": "external"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": ", pre-configured to output highly optimized static assets for production."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69143f6ded98",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Vite is opinionated and comes with sensible defaults out of the box. Read about what's possible in the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Features Guide",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vite.dev/guide/features",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Support for frameworks or integration with other tools is possible through "
        },
        {
          "text": "Plugins",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vite.dev/guide/using-plugins",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". The "
        },
        {
          "text": "Config Section",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vite.dev/config/",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " explains how to adapt Vite to your project if needed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "df359619a764",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Vite is also highly extensible via its "
        },
        {
          "text": "Plugin API",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vite.dev/guide/api-plugin",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "text": "JavaScript API",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vite.dev/guide/api-javascript",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with full typing support."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a11ded8ee978",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You can learn more about the rationale behind the project in the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Why Vite",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vite.dev/guide/why",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " section."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4aa5c185a2f0",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Learn Vite through interactive tutorials on Scrimba",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://scrimba.com/intro-to-vite-c03p6pbbdq?via=vite",
            "kind": "external"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b52ad3224e46",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "scaffolding-your-first-vite-project",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Scaffolding Your First Vite Project"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dfdc53ff5836",
      "kind": "tabs",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "npm",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "22198dd7607f",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "text": "npm create vite@latest"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Yarn",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "105259345ecf",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "text": "yarn create vite"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "pnpm",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "13a5d9c230ad",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "text": "pnpm create vite"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Bun",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "05d4181e8931",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "text": "bun create vite"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Deno",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "27294eb53499",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "text": "deno init --npm vite"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f85a5406be19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Then follow the prompts!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e56cce2ab47b",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Watch an interactive lesson on Scrimba",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://scrimba.com/intro-to-vite-c03p6pbbdq/~0yhj?via=vite",
            "kind": "external"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "19927e159052",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "tip",
      "title": "Compatibility Note",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b374c00d15b9",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Vite requires "
            },
            {
              "text": "Node.js",
              "link": {
                "href": "https://nodejs.org/en/",
                "kind": "external"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": " version 20.19+, 22.12+. However, some templates require a higher Node.js version to work, please upgrade if your package manager warns about it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "68a405c5ebba",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "note",
      "title": "Using create vite with command line options",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "199663cded13",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "You can also directly specify the project name and the template you want to use via additional command line options. For example, to scaffold a Vite + Vue project, run:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a016ccafcafd",
          "kind": "tabs",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": "npm",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "e314ed0c3b5c",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "# npm 7+, extra double-dash is needed:\nnpm create vite@latest my-vue-app -- --template vue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "Yarn",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "c03082c8a3ba",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "yarn create vite my-vue-app --template vue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "pnpm",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "466035e695d9",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "pnpm create vite my-vue-app --template vue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "Bun",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "e811b814afc2",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "bun create vite my-vue-app --template vue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "Deno",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "300b2c68d65f",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "deno init --npm vite my-vue-app --template vue"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "846005205235",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "See "
            },
            {
              "text": "create-vite",
              "link": {
                "href": "https://github.com/vitejs/vite/tree/main/packages/create-vite",
                "kind": "external"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": " for more details on each supported template: "
            },
