          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "87a2e0b9d590",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "You can use "
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "marks": [
                "code"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " for the project name to scaffold in the current directory."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9a0102244d76",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "To create a project without interactive prompts, you can use the "
            },
            {
              "text": "--no-interactive",
              "marks": [
                "code"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " flag."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "6b2d3d868f39",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "community-templates",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Community Templates"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "40319bef20c3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "create-vite is a tool to quickly start a project from a basic template for popular frameworks. Check out Awesome Vite for "
        },
        {
          "text": "community maintained templates",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://github.com/vitejs/awesome-vite#templates",
            "kind": "external"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " that include other tools or target different frameworks."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f0f55820a830",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "For a template at "
        },
        {
          "text": "https://github.com/user/project",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", you can try it out online using "
        },
        {
          "text": "https://github.stackblitz.com/user/project",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " (adding "
        },
        {
          "text": ".stackblitz",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " after "
        },
        {
          "text": "github",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to the URL of the project)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "af62ba4318ee",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You can also use a tool like "
        },
        {
          "text": "tiged",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://github.com/tiged/tiged",
            "kind": "external"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to scaffold your project with one of the templates. Assuming the project is on GitHub and uses "
        },
        {
          "text": "main",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " as the default branch, you can create a local copy using:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dcfbc22c33b3",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "bash",
      "text": "npx tiged user/project my-project\ncd my-project\n\nnpm install\nnpm run dev"
    }
  ]
}
